assistant: Here are two different implementations of calculating the nth Fibonacci number using C++:

**Implementation 1: Recursive Approach**
```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int fibonacci(int n) {
    if (n <= 1)
        return n;
    else
        return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);
}

